ly pass by everyday, including the famed City Hall Station. The subway tour will end in one of the latest transportation hubs of lower Manhattan where we will discuss of mass transit in NYC. All the stops on this tour are in stations which are publicly accessible. Guests will need to swipe once inside the subway system.","description_text":"","description_bullets":"","seo_description":"","location":"","booking_notes":"","cancellation_notes":"**Full refund for cancellations made more than 72 hours before the tour**\nNo refunds for late arrivals, no\u2011shows or cancellations within 72 hours of the tour start time.","no_transportation_notes":"","no_transportation_minutes":15,"headline":"From $42 per person","short_description":"","image_url":"","image_cdn_url":"","images":[{"cls":"Image","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/items\/322210\/images\/1382840\/","pk":1382840,"unicode":"photo","gallery":"carousel","image_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/H6rPQHbQzSOkvhT38mo3","image_cdn_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/H6rPQHbQzSOkvhT38mo3","company":{"cls":"Company","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/"},"item":{"cls":"Item","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/items\/322210\/"},"crop":{},"cropped_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/H6rPQHbQzSOkvhT38mo3","cropped_cdn_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/H6rPQHbQzSOkvhT38mo3","is_low_resolution":false,"has_text_overlay":true,"has_logo_overlay":true},{"cls":"Image","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/items\/322210\/images\/1382841\/","pk":1382841,"unicode":"photo","gallery":"carousel","image_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/4t7ODYY9S6yIHGZPjky8","image_cdn_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/4t7ODYY9S6yIHGZPjky8","company":{"cls":"Company","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/"},"item":{"cls":"Item","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/untappednewyork\/items\/322210\/"},"crop":{},"cropped_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/4t7ODYY9S6yIH